# Linux-only Ghostty settings. Selected as platform.ghostty by install.sh.

# Quick terminal toggle. global: needs a desktop that supports global shortcuts
# (xdg-desktop-portal GlobalShortcuts, e.g. KDE); the quick terminal itself needs
# Wayland with layer-shell support. Where unsupported it simply does nothing.
# Remove "global:" to make it work only while Ghostty is focused.
keybind = global:ctrl+grave_accent=toggle_quick_terminal
